- missing/corrupt/version-mismatched claim schema and ambiguous claim responses fail closed;
- committed claim + lost response/tab death blocks another automatic Send and falls back manually;
- deterministic and physical two-tab concurrency acceptance cases are now required;
- architecture reuse baseline records the selected browser-side transaction boundary;
- new `tests/test_automatic_reviewer_browser_claim_contract.py` prevents regression to non-transactional content-script ownership.

The review on HEAD 1cb7d4a0... is therefore STALE_MATERIAL_CHANGE and cannot authorize merge. A new fresh ordinary-ChatGPT review will be required after exact-head CI is green and the new head is frozen.
